<title>GREECE: SOCCER-GREECE BEAT CROATIA 2-0 IN U-21 EUROPEAN QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GREECE BEAT CROATIA 2-0 IN U-21 EUROPEAN QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>EDESSA, Greece 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece beat Croatia 2-0 (halftime 0-0) in an under-21 European soccer championship Group one qualifier on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers - Nikos Lymberopoulos 75, Sotiris Konstandinidis 90</p>
<p>Attendance: 2,000</p>
<p>    Standings	 P  W  D  L  F  A  Pts</p>
<p> Greece		 6  4  1  1  7  5   13</p>
<p> Croatia		5  2  0  3  5  6    6</p>
<p> Slovenia	     4  2  0  2  4  5    6</p>
<p> Bosnia		 4  1  1  2  3  4    4</p>
<p> Denmark		3  1  0  2  4  5    3</p>
